# Agent runtime state
.omc/
# Local agent settings carry internal paths and ids — never publish (AGENTS.md §1.3).
.claude/

# Internal WI-PF1 planning docs — kept OUT of this PUBLIC repo (privacy boundary).
# Canonical record lives in the Paperclip AUT-412 plan document.
#
# These ROOT paths stay ignored. Do not un-ignore them (AGENTS.md §4).
# The PUBLIC, design-only Impeccable context lives in docs/ instead:
#   docs/DESIGN.md   — tokens, type scale, components, heading contract
#   docs/PRODUCT.md  — register/audience, restated only from published site copy
# Impeccable resolves the project root first and docs/ second, so a private
# root DESIGN.md/PRODUCT.md dropped in locally still wins and stays unpublished.
/DESIGN.md
/PRODUCT.md
/ops/

.DS_Store
